:20,"duration":"–"}],"recommendation":[],"cost":{"m1":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 3","quantity":5},{"name":"Cutting Fluid Solution","quantity":3},{"name":"Grindstone","quantity":3}],"m2":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 3","quantity":6},{"name":"Optimized Device","quantity":3},{"name":"Transmuted Salt Agglomerate","quantity":4}],"m3":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 3","quantity":10},{"name":"D32 Steel","quantity":4},{"name":"Transmuted Salt Agglomerate","quantity":4}]},"pairings":[],"techniques":[]}],"skillCost":{"2":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 1","quantity":4}],"3":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 1","quantity":4},{"name":"Diketon","quantity":5}],"4":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 2","quantity":6},{"name":"Device","quantity":2}],"5":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 2","quantity":6},{"name":"Orirock Cube","quantity":8}],"6":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 2","quantity":6},{"name":"Fuscous Fiber","quantity":3}],"7":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 3","quantity":6},{"name":"Polyester Pack","quantity":3},{"name":"Semi-Synthetic Solvent","quantity":3}]}},"baseSkills":[{"name":"Tactic Guidance: Defense","facility":"Training Room","eliteLevel":"Base","description":"When this Operator is assigned to be the Trainer in the Training Room, Operators' Specialization training speed +10% for each Operator in the Base (excluding Assistants and Activity Room users, caps at 4 Operators)"},{"name":"Altruism","facility":"Dormitory","eliteLevel":"Elite 2","description":"When this Operator is assigned to a Dormitory, restores +0.2 Morale per hour to all Operators assigned to that Dormitory (Only the strongest effect of this type takes place)"}],"modules":[{"type":"Original","name":"Doc's Badge","stages":[]},{"type":"Upgrade","name":"INS-Y: \"The Third Power\"","mission":{"requirement1":"During battle, have Doc use Stim Pistol a total of 8 times (excluding Support Units)","requirement2":"Clear Main Theme 2-5 with a 3-star rating; You must deploy your own Doc, and cannot include any Medic Operators as members"},"stages":[{"stage":"Stage 1","attributesIncreased":"HP +100 , ATK +25 , DEF +15","effectLabel":"Trait improved","effectText":"Can also be deployed on Ranged tiles","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Refined Solvent","quantity":3},{"name":"LMD","quantity":40000}]},{"stage":"Stage 2","attributesIncreased":"HP +150 , ATK +30 , DEF +20","effectLabel":"Field Medic improved","effectText":"Max HP +15%, attacks ignore 150 DEF","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Data Supplement Stick","quantity":20},{"name":"Orirock Concentration","quantity":4},{"name":"LMD","quantity":50000}]},{"stage":"Stage 3","attributesIncreased":"HP +180 , ATK +35 , DEF +25","effectLabel":"Field Medic improved","effectText":"Max HP +18%, attacks ignore 180 DEF","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Data Supplement Instrument","quantity":8},{"name":"RMA70-24","quantity":5},{"name":"LMD","quantity":60000}]}]}],"review":{"official":"A member of\nTeam Rainbow\n, Doc's friendly attitude and willingness to lend a helping hand has earned the trust of his teammates.\nThe\nMPD-0 Stim Pistol\nthat he carries can inject medicine at a distance, providing aid to injured teammates.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":50,"base":{"hp":896,"atk":289,"def":168,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":14,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"max":{"hp":1228,"atk":413,"def":238,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":14,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"rangeId":"2-2"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":70,"base":{"hp":1228,"atk":413,"def":238,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"max":{"hp":1596,"atk":551,"def":302,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"rangeId":"2-2"},{"elite":2,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":80,"base":{"hp":1596,"atk":551,"def":302,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"max":{"hp":2217,"atk":657,"def":360,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":16,"block":2,"interval":1.05},"rangeId":"2-2"}],"trust":{"hp":150,"atk":0,"def":40}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there is no sign of infection. At this time, this operator is believed to be uninfected.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0%\nDoc shows no sign of Originium infection.\n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] Undisclosed\nThe Medical Department has agreed not to disclose the relevant data."},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"Operator Gustav 'Doc' Kateb is a member of Team Rainbow. He was involved in the Krysztauowa Incident and became an associate of Rhodes Island following the conclusion of that incident.\nDoc is an expert medical practitioner, and always ready to provide necessary aid to a patient, whether in a spotlessly clean clinic, or in the heat of the front lines.\nDoc has also demonstrated impressive medical knowledge outside of clinical practice, which has quickly earned him the trust and respect of many at Rhodes Island.\nIt is worth mentioning that Team Rainbow members are only working with us temporarily. They are not formally employed by Rhodes Island, and with how much they have on their hands, it would not be advisable to call on their help too often."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Those who have conversed with Doc inevitably leave impressed by his friendliness, kindness and patience, whether in casual conversation, work, treatment, or academic discussion.\nHe often volunteers at the Medical Department, saying it helps him learn more about our patients while reducing Medical's workload. Medical welcomed the addition of another trained doctor, though they soon realized that Doc was more than just trained.\nHe is well-versed in many fields of medicine, some of which the others have never even heard of, and he has the skilled fingers to match. After a period of acclimation, he has also learned to deal with the various symptoms of Oripathy in accordance with Rhodes Island procedures. Many are hoping that he will spend more time at Rhodes Island."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"Doc is really interested in Oripathy—of course, it would be unusual for a practitioner of medicine to not be—but you really ought to see the notes he made on the newest issue of that Oripathy journal.\nHe has a notebook filled with clippings about the Infected. He's normally such a good-tempered guy, but you could see him seethe with anger at the injustices faced by the Infected. It makes me feel ashamed.\nWhy am I ashamed?\nHis anger makes me realize that I've become numb to the persecution of the Infected. It's a much-needed reminder that injustice is injustice, even if all the lands are used to it. I have the right... nay, the responsibility to be angry.\n—A Medical Department Operator"},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"For Rhodes Island, Doc is a collaborator, a helping hand, a respectable man. For Team Rainbow, things are even simpler. In his own words, 'My job is to ensure your safety. I don't mind a challenge.'\nDoc does not shield everyone like Blitz, cause spectacular explosions like Fuze, achieve his goals with the artistry of Ela, or deliver surprises like Frost, but nothing reassures the members of Team Rainbow like the voice of Doc through their communicator.\nHe says his job is to ensure the safety of his teammates. And he means it."},{"section":"Promotion Record","unlock":"Unlocked at E2","description":"[Classified Log]\nI had pulled three all-nighters in a row when Doc's request arrived, and I almost fitted a barrel meant for Originium-Keton ammunition onto the stim pistol.\nIt's still the Team Rainbow weapon that I had the easiest time modifying. It's propelled by high-pressure gas, and works on largely the same principles as standard gas-powered launchers. I modified it to use standard-issue gas canisters, which also necessitated a couple of tweaks to reduce the muzzle velocity, because it's meant to treat the wounded, not to substitute for Gavial's violence.\nOn another note, please stop submitting Doc's applications to Engineering at the same time as anything from the Doctor! It's so confusing. Doc almost went into battle carrying a freshly repaired water boiler rather than his stim pistol, if Closure hadn't realized that something was off."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Doc%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Doc%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Doc%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Doc%20-%20Elite%202.webp"},{"label":"Exhibition","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Doc%20-%20Exhibition.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Doc%20-%20Exhibition.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{"Exhibition":"18 OP"},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Guard","type":"class","entries":[{"operatorName":"Pepe","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Pepe%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When deployed, all [Guard] Operators gain +20% (+4%) ATK","matchedKeyword":"Guard"}]},{"operatorName":"Bison","operatorIconPath":"/five-star-icons/Bison%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"DEF +70 (+20) ; If a Vanguard or Guard is deployed behind Bison, that Vanguard or Guard gains the same effect.","matchedKeyword":"Guard"}]},{"operatorName":"Wild Mane","operatorIconPath":"/five-star-icons/Wild%20Mane%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"After dep